Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.27,0:00:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is the destiny of mankind controlled\Nby some transcendental entity? Or law?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it like the hand of God hovering above?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least, it is true that man has
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no control even over his own will.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.08,0:00:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have arrived at a crucial moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.36,0:00:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our backs are to the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stake your lives on this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our survival demands that we\Nstake our lives on this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to survive is to be victorious.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.28,0:01:04.43,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}Feel no shame about shape.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.44,0:01:06.38,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}Weather changes their phrase.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.41,0:01:10.18,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}Even mother will show you another way.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.18,0:01:12.49,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}So put your glasses on.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.49,0:01:14.55,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}Nothing will be wrong.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.55,0:01:16.78,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}There's no blame. There's no fame.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.82,0:01:18.62,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}It's up to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.69,0:01:22.28,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}The first words should be found.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.80,0:01:25.89,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}Whatever holds you back.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.53,0:01:27.29,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}I...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.53,0:01:28.37,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}...can...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.37,0:01:30.56,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}I can get it off.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.57,0:01:31.60,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}Tell me what...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.64,0:01:32.57,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}Tell me what...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.57,0:01:34.40,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}Tell me what you want.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.44,0:01:35.56,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}I don't know why...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.61,0:01:36.50,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}Don't know why...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.51,0:01:38.47,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}Don't know why you're afraid.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.58,0:01:39.65,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}Tell me what...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.65,0:01:40.61,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}Tell me what...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.68,0:01:42.27,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}Tell me what you'd say.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.42,0:01:43.61,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}I don't know why...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.65,0:01:44.68,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}Don't know why...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.68,0:01:45.49,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}Too late...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.49,0:01:47.14,op,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fax-0.21}It's too late.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:52.09,0:01:56.10,signs,,0,0,0,,{\3a&H55&\3c&HFEFEFE&\shad0\bord0\blur0.8\fn@CRPCandGHankoinMSt\fs48\c&H000D92&\b1\pos(477,472)}The Conqueror
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.09,0:01:56.10,signs,,0,0,0,,{\3a&H55&\3c&HFEFEFE&\shad0\bord4.2\blur2.5\fn@CRPCandGHankoinMSt\fs48\c&H000D92&\b0\pos(477,472)}The Conqueror
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.88,0:02:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.03,0:02:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.32,0:02:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dry
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.54,0:02:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sand
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.52,0:02:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.43,0:02:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,flying everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hardly see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.82,0:02:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it seems certain that\Nour army will be victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.98,0:02:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, everyone guarding\Nthe castle has gone to the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.06,0:02:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's because the reward for the\Nenemy's head is anything they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.82,0:02:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.73,0:02:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.65,0:02:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just greedy,\Nevery last one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imagine our bad luck having\Nto stand sentry today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.60,0:02:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.52,0:03:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.80,0:03:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did they come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.58,0:03:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.55,0:03:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First formation, block\Noff all the castle gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.00,0:03:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Second formation, charge the parapets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.34,0:03:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let any enemy\Nmessengers leave the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.25,0:03:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, there isn't a moment to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.46,0:03:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.82,0:03:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You move in from the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.04,0:03:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.64,0:03:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.78,0:04:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.69,0:04:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.61,0:04:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I must say you are persistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.52,0:04:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am well known as the\Nindestructible Baron Adon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.48,0:04:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inevitably, everyone bows down\Nbefore my incredible vitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, Adon, had seen through\Nyour cheap tricks long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.14,0:04:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, I offered my\Nservices as castle guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and have waited patiently as you\Nmarched ignorantly toward us. Liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.27,0:04:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.46,0:04:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.09,0:04:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold the Blue Whale, super\Nstrong heavy assault knights!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.43,0:04:49.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I purposely left my troops\Ninside the castle for justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.31,0:04:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,"Occasion," now I intend to have\Nmy revenge for our previous battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.12,0:04:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.03,0:04:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not allow any of them\Nto escape with their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.74,0:04:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.65,0:05:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll avenge my brother Samson's death!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I give you no format!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.39,0:05:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.77,0:05:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,keeping
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.26,0:05:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.03,0:05:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They keep me waiting far too\Nlong for Griffith's capture?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.34,0:05:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.52,0:05:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is a single horseman of great skill\Nwho blocks our way to Count Griffith.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.48,0:05:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are unable to gain\Nany ground against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.32,0:05:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Useless is what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.66,0:05:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.34,0:05:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone who can stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.58,0:06:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,General Boscone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.38,0:06:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The general will do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.42,0:06:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,♪♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.42,0:06:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,♪♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.12,0:06:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.09,0:06:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.36,0:06:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stay out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.02,0:06:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no place in the\Nmiddle of that fierce battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.60,0:07:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did it! That's our commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.73,0:07:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is it that your swordplay\Nis better than it was before?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't exactly feeling\Nwell the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.36,0:07:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.82,0:07:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough of your weak excuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:15.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least wait till I'm finished speaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.32,0:07:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about shutting your mouth instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.13,0:07:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy is weak and few in number!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.00,0:07:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destroy them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.18,0:07:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The future of the Hawks\Nrests on victory here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.76,0:07:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pippin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.91,0:07:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.98,0:07:48.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.89,0:07:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a matter of time\Nbefore we're wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.72,0:07:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're outnumbered.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.63,0:07:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Corkus?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.38,0:07:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we should just desert?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.70,0:08:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not saying that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.90,0:08:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If deserting is the only way to\Nsurvive, then I choose to die! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.61,0:08:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little Rickert has gone completely mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.20,0:08:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We stay this to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.98,0:08:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My army has completely overwhelmed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.34,0:08:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack and overpower them entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.42,0:08:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss Karn, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.44,0:08:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you taking so long\Nto battle a single horseman?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.38,0:08:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man is incredibly strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.50,0:08:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel closer to death now than\Nwhen I was slaughtering 100 men.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.36,0:08:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either I put everything\Non the line now, or I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.83,0:08:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.84,0:08:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been through worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.54,0:09:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This hopelessness is nothing\Ncompared to what I felt then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.12,0:09:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.43,0:09:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dare
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.66,0:09:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.06,0:09:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one thing left to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.81,0:09:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.70,0:09:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.71,0:09:48.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon for my lack of courtesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.16,0:09:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.34,0:09:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm just a lowly commander\Nfollowing orders from the general.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.56,0:09:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myself, I never wanted to hold a\Ngrudge against you, you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.94,0:09:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now please, I offer you the\Ncastle if that's what you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.64,0:10:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the last person who would\Never stand in your way and I
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.44,0:10:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,graciously thank you for sparing my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.40,0:10:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You disgust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.52,0:10:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My clever ruse has put you off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Casca!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.32,0:10:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foolish woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.34,0:10:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was Rasha Jinrai, the secret\Nart of the crossbow sneak attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.44,0:10:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,passed down through the Korbowitz\Nfamily for a thousand years!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.17,0:10:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tip of the arrow is poison, and\Nthat poison will numb your entire body!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.72,0:10:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your days of sinful deeds\Nare over, evil bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.72,0:10:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot afford to play your\Nfoolish games any longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.30,0:10:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.49,0:10:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.84,0:10:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.02,0:11:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sword must have cracked\Nduring the last battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.98,0:11:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is over, boy commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.67,0:11:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might be
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.28,0:11:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,willing to keep you around
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.32,0:11:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as my personal toy if you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.99,0:11:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were to meekly and\Nobediently surrender now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.42,0:11:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you refuse...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.36,0:11:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.81,0:11:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, that poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.71,0:11:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going numb!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.42,0:11:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.78,0:12:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what will you do now that\Nyou can no longer evade my blows?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.74,0:12:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for what you did to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.96,0:12:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First I'll chop off your\Narms and then your legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.28,0:12:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you can
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.19,0:12:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,decide whether or not you'll be my\Ncaptive, and I'll listen at my leisure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.66,0:12:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll start with your legs! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.76,0:12:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.88,0:12:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.05,0:12:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were a fairly interesting man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.08,0:12:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In addition to being a\Nvile, revolting bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.90,0:12:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.87,0:12:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest of them are no match!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.38,0:12:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.16,0:13:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.47,0:13:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.47,0:13:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.56,0:13:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're no match for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.17,0:13:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unwanted fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.32,0:13:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guts, take that sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.47,0:14:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.61,0:14:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He finally beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.18,0:14:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.83,0:14:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's utterly helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.34,0:14:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.80,0:14:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ser Baskorn is an invincible knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.76,0:14:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.75,0:14:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am in charge now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.97,0:14:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.10,0:14:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still have the upper hand, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.56,0:14:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Governor, look at that! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.59,0:14:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.28,0:14:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.90,0:14:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy's flag?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.06,0:14:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have we surrendered?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.20,0:14:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.27,0:14:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you men? Idiots?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.98,0:14:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your head has been cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.92,0:15:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your general is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.53,0:15:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your castle has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.10,0:15:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you haven't\Nfigured it out yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.32,0:15:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.41,0:15:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.46,0:15:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone give a shout for victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.68,0:15:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on, we will hunt\Nwhat remains of the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.62,0:15:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let them pass if
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.53,0:15:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they flee the battlefield, but should\Nthey resist, exterminate them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.47,0:15:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.07,0:15:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the commander-in-chief\Nhere, and I am still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.47,0:16:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Griffith!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while, hasn't\Nit, Governor Gennon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.72,0:16:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Griffith, I missed you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.10,0:16:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and I, we've always\Nhelped one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.50,0:16:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are going to let me\Nescape unharmed, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.39,0:16:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I even gave the soldiers strict orders\Nthat you are absolutely not to be harmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.98,0:16:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You understand the feelings I\Nhold in my heart, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.59,0:16:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a day has passed that\NI haven't thought of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.80,0:16:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We loved each other\Npassionately on that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.30,0:16:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have sympathy towards me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.06,0:16:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will listen to my plea, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.18,0:16:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.82,0:16:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.64,0:16:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't bear any ill\Nwill towards me, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.64,0:17:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not bear any ill feelings at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.80,0:17:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my hawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.04,0:17:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, it upsets me to hear\Nyou speak of us making love.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.02,0:17:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for I feel less than nothing towards\Nyou, either ill feelings or otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.50,0:17:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Griffith?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.53,0:17:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took advantage of an opportunity,\Nand it just so happened it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.74,0:17:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was you that was there at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.16,0:17:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I simply picked up a pebble\Nthat was lying in my path,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.17,0:17:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and by mere chance, that pebble was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.66,0:17:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At any rate, a chattering\Npebble is quite a nuisance,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.98,0:17:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.37,0:17:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.74,0:17:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm feeling a bit better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.09,0:18:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.16,0:18:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must check to see if there are still\Nany enemies remaining in the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.18,0:18:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.26,0:18:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.17,0:18:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.22,0:18:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.13,0:18:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.17,0:18:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.22,0:18:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.00,0:18:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.92,0:18:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.17,0:18:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But to tell you the truth, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.44,0:18:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could really use your shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:19:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.67,0:19:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.76,0:19:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always feel this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.70,0:19:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever I see Griffith surrounded\Nby his comrades like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.98,0:19:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my heart is filled with sorrow\Nbecause he seems so far away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.77,0:19:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beyond my reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.05,0:19:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.48,0:19:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.76,0:19:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to go and greet your commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.54,0:19:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it couldn't have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.78,0:20:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.45,0:20:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time of the great
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.94,0:20:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eclipse draws near.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.67,0:20:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon the demon kings will descend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.41,0:20:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The castle of Doldrey has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.23,0:20:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the time being, our\Nlong war is at an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.67,0:20:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then Griffith will be\Nfree to let his political
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.74,0:20:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,views intr ude upon the\Nadministration of our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.77,0:20:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is shameless enough to do just\Nthat, despite his low social standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.25,0:20:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His Majesty seems to\Nrely on him very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.05,0:20:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of the services\Nhe has already provided,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.96,0:20:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he will receive the position of General.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.33,0:20:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Outrageous!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.24,0:20:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His Majesty will soon give him and\Nhis hawks the title of White Knights,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.07,0:21:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,previously born only by the\NWhite Tigers and White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.65,0:21:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.56,0:21:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll have supreme command\Nof the entire army.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.15,0:21:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.06,0:21:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he will be able to take\Neven more license with the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.86,0:21:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.77,0:21:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it appears that his\Nsurvival skills within these
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.15,0:21:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,castle walls will prove\Nto be somewhat lacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.73,0:21:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.41,0:21:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Antiaris.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.32,0:21:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a poison that acts instantaneously.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.43,0:21:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shall use this on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.16,0:21:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you thought this all the way through?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.15,0:21:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this were traced back to us,\Nthe consequences would be dire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.43,0:21:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We would never do such a thing\Npersonally, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.01,0:21:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.24,0:21:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.09,0:21:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.27,0:21:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feel free to leave everything in my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.16,0:22:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.19,0:22:06.28,ed,,0,0,0,,{\org(0,0)\fad(500,700)\blur0.5}Looking back, the morning comes.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.30,0:22:09.31,ed,,0,0,0,,{\an7\org(0,0)\pos(416,37)\fad(480,500)\blur0.5}Don't find your face in your glass.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.31,0:22:13.76,ed,,0,0,0,,{\org(0,0)\fad(470,700)\blur0.5}Take the moonlight by the tail.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.73,0:22:17.43,ed,,0,0,0,,{\an7\org(0,0)\pos(418,37)\fad(700,1200)\blur0.5}It's a rainy sight. You're shading.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.50,0:22:19.99,ed,,0,0,0,,{\org(0,0)\fad(700,1100)\blur0.5}What is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.97,0:22:21.36,ed,,0,0,0,,{\an7\org(0,0)\pos(418,37)\fad(700,1100)\blur0.5}It's just the same.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.32,0:22:24.32,ed,,0,0,0,,{\org(0,0)\fad(490,500)\blur0.5}What is trying your crown?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.32,0:22:29.33,ed,,0,0,0,,{\an7\org(0,0)\pos(418,37)\fad(500,500)\blur0.5}I'm spending my glass, walking back.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.58,0:22:32.14,ed,,0,0,0,,{\org(0,0)\fad(700,1100)\blur0.5}So wear my glass. You're fading.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.11,0:22:35.38,ed,,0,0,0,,{\an7\org(0,0)\pos(418,37)\fad(700,1100)\blur0.5}I'm waiting so long.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.85,0:22:39.22,ed,,0,0,0,,{\org(0,0)\fad(700,1100)\blur0.5}I'm waiting so long.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.69,0:22:42.95,ed,,0,0,0,,{\an7\org(0,0)\pos(418,37)\fad(700,1100)\blur0.5}I'm waiting so long.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.39,0:22:46.82,ed,,0,0,0,,{\org(0,0)\fad(700,1100)\blur0.5}I'm waiting so long.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.50,0:22:49.73,ed,,0,0,0,,{\an7\org(0,0)\pos(418,37)\fad(700,1100)\blur0.5}I'm waiting so long.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.35,0:22:54.36,ed,,0,0,0,,{\org(0,0)\fad(480,500)\blur0.5}I'm waiting...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.47,0:23:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.40,0:23:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it a
Dialogue: 2,0:23:07.36,0:23:09.37,signs,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFEFEFE&\3a&H60&\3c&HFEFEFE&\shad0\bord0\blur1.5\fn@CRPCandGHankoinMSt\fs42\pos(483,454)}Next Episode
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.36,0:23:09.37,signs,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFEFEFE&\3a&H60&\3c&HFEFEFE&\shad0\bord2.5\blur6\fn@CRPCandGHankoinMSt\fs42\pos(483,454)}Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.77,0:23:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,man strives
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.17,0:23:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to reach the summit?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.95,0:23:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it he craves the\Nthunder of applause,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.18,0:23:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dreams, ambition, love, hope?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.21,0:23:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this world, could the glories\Nof a youthful heart be forbidden?
Dialogue: 2,0:23:34.39,0:23:37.40,signs,,0,0,0,,{\3a&H60&\3c&HFEFEFE&\shad0\bord0\blur0.8\fn@CRPCandGHankoinMSt\fs48\c&H000D92&\b1\pos(479,460)}Moment of Glory
Dialogue: 1,0:23:34.39,0:23:37.40,signs,,0,0,0,,{\3a&H60&\3c&HFEFEFE&\shad0\bord4.2\blur2.5\fn@CRPCandGHankoinMSt\fs48\c&H000D92&\b0\pos(479,460)}Moment of Glory
